sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant Input as Native control in Shadow DOM
  participant Element as Custom element
  participant Clock as Shared PinballKit clock
  participant Render as Shared WebGL renderer
  participant Audio as Shared sound controller
  participant App as Consuming application

  User->>Input: Pointer / touch / keyboard action
  Input->>Element: Component handler updates state
  Element->>Clock: Start / continue animation frames
  Clock->>Element: frame(dt)
  Element->>Render: Draw current scene and ball state
  Render-->>Element: Copy render to element canvas
  Element->>Audio: Request kick / relay / chime / roll effect
  Element-->>App: Bubbling, composed CustomEvent
  App->>Element: Read public property or method
